.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

.claude/settings.local.json

# Guard against drag-drop pollution: plugin files belong under plugins/** and
# .claude-plugin/**, never at the repo root. These root-anchored ignores catch strays.
/*.sh
/hooks.json
/marketplace.json
/plugin.json
.env

# Byte-code from running the shipped Python tooling (scripts/, plugins/**/scripts/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated HTML renderings (scripts/build_coverage_artifact.py). NOT `dist/`, deliberately:
# `dist/` holds the committed `.skill` artifacts, and the packaging check is "run
# package_core.py, then confirm `git status` shows only the intended dist/ change" — an
# untracked HTML file there would sit inside the very signal that check reads. These are
# renderings, not sources: regenerate rather than commit.
/build

# Paid third-party book screenshots (Every Layout) — reference only, never redistribute.
# Licensed design references — study locally, NEVER commit (see EPIC #89).
# They live in a SEPARATE PRIVATE repo, cloned into `design-corpora/` (see CLAUDE.md,
# "Design corpora"), never in this history: committing ~656 MB of licensed blobs here could
# only be undone with `git filter-repo` + a force-push, which rewrites every commit SHA and
# detaches the release tags.
#
# NO TRAILING SLASH on any of these, deliberately (#197). A trailing slash matches a real
# DIRECTORY only, and git stores a symlink as mode 120000 — so `tailwind-ui/` never matched
# the `ln -s` the setup instructions prescribed, and all three corpora sat UNTRACKED in the
# very guard written to hide them. Slash-free also matches a path that does not exist yet,
# which is what lets `maintainer_doctor.py` prove these patterns still work.
/design-corpora

# The pre-#197 root-level layout. Kept ignored — a machine still holding it must not be one
# `git add -A` away from committing licensed blobs. `/flowbite*` subsumes the old
# `flowbite*.zip` and `flowbite-figma/` entries.
/everylayout
/tailwind-ui
/flowbite*

# Dependency trees are never committed. (Was missing: the flowbite bundles carry two
# node_modules trees, which the old root-level `flowbite*/` happened to cover — this makes it
# explicit. They now sit under `/design-corpora`, so this stands alone for any other tree.)
node_modules/
